          {
            "title": "Variables in functions",
            "id": 80268,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Başlangıç olarak, fonksiyonların içinde değişkenleri kullanabiliriz. Örneğin <code> name = \"Ron\"</code> oluşturup bunu görüntüleme ifadesinde kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_ron\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ron&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hello, \" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet_ron()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Ron\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>name</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>\"Ron\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonların içinde değişkenleri ve onların değerlerini görüntüleme ifadelerinde kullanabiliriz.</p><p>Fonksiyonun içinde adı kaydet ve kodun <code>Hello, Ron</code> yazdırmasını sağla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_ron\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ron&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hello, \" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet_ron()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Ron\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>name</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>\"Ron\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Similar code",
            "id": 80276,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Başka bir kişiyi nasıl selamlardık? Benzer kodla yeni bir <code>greet_leslie()</code> fonksiyonu oluşturup çağırabilirdik.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_ron\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ron&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hello, \" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet_ron()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_leslie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Leslie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hello, \" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet_leslie()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"146\" /><option startIndex=\"146\" endIndex=\"147\" /><option startIndex=\"147\" endIndex=\"148\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Ron\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hello, Leslie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>greet_leslie()</code>, ardından <code>greet_leslie</code> ve sonra <code>(</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>greet_leslie</code> adlı ikinci bir fonksiyon oluştur. <code>Hello, Leslie</code> satırını eklemek için fonksiyonu çağır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_ron\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ron&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hello, \" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet_ron()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_leslie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Leslie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hello, \" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet_leslie()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"146\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greet_ron\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Ron&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Ron\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hello, Leslie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>greet_leslie</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>\"Leslie\"</code> ve son olarak <code>greet_leslie</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Passing",
            "id": 80269,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İki fonksiyon yazmak yerine, kodu tekrarlamadan <code>\"Leslie\"</code> gibi belirli bir bilgiyi yalnızca bir fonksiyona aktarabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hello, \" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;April&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leslie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"72\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, April\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hello, Leslie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Leslie\"</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodu tekrarlamak yerine belirli bilgileri tek bir fonksiyona aktarabilirsin.</p><p>Kodun önce <code>Hello, April</code>, ardından <code>Hello, Leslie</code> yazdırması için iki ad aktar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hello, \" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;April&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leslie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Ron&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, April\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hello, Leslie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"April\"</code>, ardından <code>\"Leslie\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameter",
            "id": 80270,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyona değer geçirmek için önce fonksiyonun parantezlerinin içine <strong>parametre</strong> adı verilen bir değişken ekleriz. Burada <code>name</code> değerini geçireceğiz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"14\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>name</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameter",
            "id": 80271,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buradaki <code>name</code> parametresi, bir değeri depolayan değişken gibi davranır. Ancak henüz içinde bir değer yok.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hello, \" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>name</code>, ardından <code>name</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parametre, fonksiyon parantezlerinin içindeki bir değişkendir. Fonksiyon çağrılırken aktarılan değeri saklar.</p><p>Selamlamada kullanılan parametreyi ekle ve onu görüntüleyen çağrıyı tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hello, \" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"names\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>name</code>, ardından <code>print</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Passing a value",
            "id": 80272,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değişkene bir değer aktarmak için fonksiyonu çağırdığımızda, tıpkı <code>greet(\"Anna\")</code> örneğinde olduğu gibi bu değeri parantezlerin arasına yerleştiririz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hello, \" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Anna\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>greet</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>\"Anna\"</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değer aktarmak için fonksiyonu çağırırken değeri parantezlerin içine yerleştir.</p><p>Kodun <code>Hello, Anna</code> yazdırması için fonksiyonu çağır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hello, \" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Leslie&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Anna\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>greet</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>\"Anna\"</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
